.TH ASIKAD 1 "2026-05-04" "Asika" "System Commands"
.SH NAME
asikad \- Asika Daemon with merge queue, web dashboard, and bot integrations
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B asikad
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B asikad
daemon provides the backend for Asika PR management.
It handles merge queue processing, web dashboard, webhook events,
and bot integrations (Telegram, Feishu, Discord).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-desktop
Run in desktop foreground mode.
Opens browser to WebUI automatically.
.TP
.BI \-version
Print version and exit.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B ASIKA_CONFIG
Path to configuration file.
Default is
.BI /etc/asika_config.toml .
.SH CONFIGURATION
Configuration is stored in TOML format.
See
.B asika.toml.example
for full reference.
.SS Server Configuration
.TP
.B [server]
listen = ":8080"
.br
mode = "release"
.br
enable_web_update = true
.SS Database
.TP
.B [database]
path = "/var/lib/asika/asika.db"
.SS Authentication
.TP
.B [auth]
jwt_secret = "secret"
.br
token_expiry = "72h"
.SS Platform Tokens
.TP
.B [tokens]
github = "ghp_xxx"
.br
gitlab = "glpat-xxx"
.br
gitea = "gitea_xxx"
.SS Events
.TP
.B [events]
mode = "webhook"
.br
webhook_secret = "secret"
.br
polling_interval = "5m"
.SS Merge Queue
.TP
.B [[repo_groups]]
name = "my-project"
.br
mode = "single"
.br
github = "owner/repo"
.SS Spam Detection
.TP
.B [spam]
enabled = true
.br
threshold = 3
.SS Stale PR Management
.TP
.B [stale]
enabled = true
.br
days_until_stale = 21
.SS Bot Integrations
.TP
.B [telegram]
enabled = true
.br
token = "bot-token"
.TP
.B [feishu]
enabled = true
.br
app_id = "cli_xxx"
.TP
.B [discord]
enabled = true
.br
token = "discord-token"
.SH API ENDPOINTS
.SS Authentication
.TP
.B POST /api/v1/auth/login
Login with username/password.
.TP
.B POST /api/v1/auth/logout
Logout.
.SS PR Management
.TP
.B GET /api/v1/repos/:group/prs
List PRs (filters: state, platform, is_draft, author, label).
.TP
.B GET /api/v1/repos/:group/prs/:id
Get PR details.
.TP
.B POST /api/v1/repos/:group/prs/:id/approve
Approve PR.
.TP
.B POST /api/v1/repos/:group/prs/:id/close
Close PR.
.TP
.B POST /api/v1/repos/:group/prs/:id/reopen
Reopen PR.
.TP
.B POST /api/v1/repos/:group/prs/:id/spam
Mark as spam.
.TP
.B POST /api/v1/repos/:group/prs/:id/comment
Comment on PR.
.TP
.B POST /api/v1/repos/:group/prs/batch/approve
Batch approve PRs.
.TP
.B POST /api/v1/repos/:group/prs/batch/close
Batch close PRs.
.TP
.B POST /api/v1/repos/:group/prs/batch/label
Batch label PRs.
.SS Queue Management
.TP
.B GET /api/v1/queue/:group
Get merge queue.
.TP
.B POST /api/v1/queue/:group/recheck
Trigger queue recheck.
.SS Audit Logs
.TP
.B GET /api/v1/logs
Get audit logs (?level=info|warn|error).
.SS Configuration
.TP
.B GET /api/v1/config
Get current config (admin only).
.TP
.B PUT /api/v1/config
Update config (admin only, hot-reloadable).
.SS Self-Update
.TP
.B GET /api/v1/self-update/check
Check for new version.
.TP
.B GET /api/v1/self-update/run
Perform self-update (SSE progress).
.SS Webhooks
.TP
.B POST /webhook/:group/:platform
Receive platform webhooks.
.TP
.B POST /api/v1/feishu/event
Feishu event callback.
.SS Health Check
.TP
.B GET /health
Health check endpoint.
.SH WEB DASHBOARD
The web dashboard is available at the server address (default: http://localhost:8080).
.TP
.B /wizard
First-time setup wizard.
.TP
.B /login
User login page.
.TP
.B /dashboard
Main dashboard with statistics.
.TP
.B /prs
PR list view.
.TP
.B /prs/:id
Individual PR detail view.
.TP
.B /queue
Merge queue view.
.TP
.B /users
User management (admin).
.TP
.B /config
Configuration editor (admin).
.SH INSTALLATION
Install the binary and setup systemd service:
.TP
Copy binary:
.B cp asikad /usr/local/bin/
.TP
Install service:
.B cp pack/debian/asikad.service /etc/systemd/system/
.TP
Enable and start:
.B systemctl enable asikad && systemctl start asikad
.SH FILES
.I /etc/asika_config.toml
Main configuration file.
.I /var/lib/asika/asika.db
Default database path.
.I /var/log/asikad.log
Log file (if configured).
